 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 508741,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Solve using the quadratic formula: <span data-math=\"3{y^2} - 5y + 2 = 0\">3{y^2} - 5y + 2 = 0</span>.",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<table class=\"unnumbered unstyled\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"3{y^2} - 5y + 2 = 0\"></span></td>\n<td>The equation is in standard form.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>For the quadratic formula, <span data-math=\"a = 3\"></span>, <span data-math=\"b = -5\"></span>, and <span data-math=\"c = 2\"></span>.</p>\n<p>The solutions to the equation can be found with the quadratic formula <span data-math=\"\\frac{{ - b \\pm \\sqrt {{b^2} - 4ac} }}{{2a}}\"></span>.</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered unstyled\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"\\frac{{ - \\left({ - 5} \\right) \\pm \\sqrt {{{\\left({ - 5} \\right)}^2} - 4\\left(3 \\right)\\left(2 \\right)} }}{{2\\left(3 \\right)}}\"></span></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>Substitute.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"\\frac{{5 \\pm \\sqrt {25 - 24} }}{6}\"></span></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>Simplify.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"\\frac{{5 \\pm \\sqrt 1 }}{6}\"></span></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"\\frac{{5 \\pm 1}}{6}\"></span></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"y = \\frac{{5 + 1}}{6}\"></span></td>\n<td><span data-math=\"y = \\frac{{5 - 1}}{6}\"></span></td>\n<td>Rewrite to show two solutions.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"y = \\frac{6}{6}\"></span></td>\n<td><span data-math=\"y = \\frac{4}{6}\"></span></td>\n<td>Simplify.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"y = 1\"></span></td>\n<td><span data-math=\"y = \\frac{2}{3}\"></span></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Checking is left for you.</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"y = 1\">y = 1</span>, <span data-math=\"y = \\frac{2}{3}\">y = \\frac{2}{3}</span>"
    }
   ],
